Change a block's type from the sidebar: the current block's title in the sidebar header is a dropdown of the types it can be converted to, and the sidebar's `•••` menu "Convert to…" opens the same list. The toolbar's "Convert to…", the dropdown and the menu share one list of targets (`getConvertTargets`) and one conversion (`convertBlockInPlace`, now in `@volto-hydra/helpers` blockSync), done straight away, so a container converted from the sidebar keeps and converts its children as it does from the toolbar; the sidebar's own `convertBlockType` path, which dropped a container's children, is gone. #749
